Paper triage.  Section II defines the generalized closed butterfly
V_i(x,y)=(R_i(x,y),R_i(y,x)) over GF(2^n), with
R_i(x,y)=(x+alpha*y)^(2^i+1)+beta*y^(2^i+1).  Theorem 1 fixes the exact good-
