+        "Track B: exact restricted-support interpolation followed by Gaussian "
+        "elimination is polynomial in the displayed basis size and recovered "
+        "the shipping inverses in the measured operation count recorded by "
+        "selftest, whereas Theorem 3.1 compresses the same calculation to "
+        "well under 300 exact field operations once the x^p+x blocks are seen."
